  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "GSearch: solve the truncated special characters problem. Proposed by Leire Urcelay:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "When doing a search, the fields having field.lenght > fieldMaxLength are truncated using getBestFragments method. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If the field contains some special characters, like &apos;, it can happen that this special character is cut.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For example, the field â€œIl est donc intÃ©ressant de se pencher sur l'acquisitionâ€ is transformed into â€œIl est donc intÃ©ressant de se pencher sur l &apos ... â€œ.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This transformation should produce an error during the XSLT transformation. Currently, this is not the case, since there is a strange transformation in the code. In fact, all â€œ&â€ characters are transformed in â€œ#â€ character.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "You can see it in the method executeQuery of the class Statement.java:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "snippets = highlighter.getBestFragments(tokenStream, f.stringValue(), snippetsMax, \" ... \");",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "snippets = snippets.replace('&', '#');",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Due to this character replacement, there is not any error in the xsl transformation, but however, there is a problem when displaying the result. Instead of getting:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "â€œIl est donc intÃ©ressant de se pencher sur lâ€™ ...â€",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The following is displayed:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "â€œIl est donc intÃ©ressant de se pencher sur l #apos ...â€",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The current solution with '#' was a tradeoff. A more satisfactory solution should be included in the next version of GSearch.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
